Package: envwindowr
Type: Package
Title: Environmental Window Discovery for Trait Associations
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Paul",
    family = "Adunola",
    email = "adunolapaul@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Finds environmental time windows whose summarized weather variables
    are associated with phenotypic traits across environments. It accepts user-
    supplied daily weather data, supports environment-specific seasons, fixed or
    variable window sizes, robust validation, multiple correlation methods,
    multiplicity adjustment, diagnostics, rankings, and publication-ready plots.
    It also provides input templates and can retrieve historical daily weather
    from coordinates and environment-specific season dates.
